 forced-sequence completion. It also rejects negative/out-of-range rows, zero
 dimensions/rows, malformed pending and verification vector sizes, and a null
-draft-input destination. It does not read production source text.
+draft-input destination. The scheduler-to-batch payload test retains FULL and
